00:05:51.117 --> 00:05:52.719
We need

00:05:53.419 --> 00:05:55.621
to make the Chinese understand

00:05:55.621 --> 00:05:58.725
that, like the party's over.

00:05:58.725 --> 00:06:00.993
For the last 50 years,

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:04.397
