00:06:16.843 --> 00:06:18.344
over a long period of time, and by great

00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:21.414
I mean a large volume of it.

00:06:21.414 --> 00:06:22.949
But the Chinese have taken advantage

00:06:22.949 --> 00:06:24.684
