00:07:01.788 --> 00:07:03.523
That's stealing from you.

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:06.025
Tick tock is here in this country.

00:07:06.626 --> 00:07:08.394
We let them in.

00:07:08.394 --> 00:07:10.463
Facebook and Twitter are not in China.

00:07:13.399 --> 00:07:14.300
They want Facebook.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.301
They're going to get Facebook, Twitter

00:07:15.301 --> 00:07:16.803
and our social media into China.

00:07:16.803 --> 00:07:17.503
On the tick tock.

00:07:17.503 --> 00:07:19.772
Say they don't tick tock goes

00:07:19.772 --> 00:07:21.240
the Christie administration.

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.209
They need to understand

00:07:23.209 --> 00:07:25.311
that we will be fair,

00:07:26.112 --> 00:07:28.514
but we won't be chumps.

00:07:28.648 --> 00:07:31.317
And so I don't want to give that away.

00:07:31.884 --> 00:07:35.988
On the CNN town hall in June of 2023,

00:07:36.589 --> 00:07:37.356
I want to use it

00:07:37.356 --> 00:07:38.458
as a card

00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:39.392
that we can negotiate

00:07:39.392 --> 00:07:41.327
with going forward smartly.

00:07:41.327 --> 00:07:43.763
So that we we write this relationship

00:07:44.363 --> 00:07:45.064
because if we don't

00:07:45.064 --> 00:07:46.132
write this relationship,

00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:48.968
it will be the relationship

00:07:48.968 --> 00:07:50.870
that defines

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:53.072
the world for the next 50 years.

00:07:53.072 --> 00:07:54.540
And I'd rather have to have that

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:55.875
be a prosperous,

00:07:55.875 --> 00:07:57.977
fair, competitive relationship

00:07:58.511 --> 00:07:59.512
rather than a relationship

00:07:59.512 --> 00:08:01.047
